{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1483162-best-use-of-predator-flaws","id":1483162,"title":"Best use of Predator flaws","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-05T12:40:53-07:00","id":1483162,"title":"Best use of Predator flaws","content":"What is the best use of the flaw of each Predator type you have witnessed in a game?<br /> <br /> Best use of the Bagger's enemy?<br /> <br /> Best use of the Blood Leech's Shunned/Dark Secret?<br /> <br /> Best use of the Cleaver's Dark Secret?<br /> <br /> Best use of the Consensualist's Dark Secret and Feeding Exclusion?<br /> <br /> Best use of the Farmer's Feeding Exclusion?<br /> <br /> Best use of the Osiris's Enemy/Mythic Flaw?<br /> <br /> Best use of the Sandman's....okay nevermind they don't get a flaw<br /> <br /> Best use of the Siren's Disliked or Feeding Flaw?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-09T09:52:35-07:00","id":1483475,"title":"","content":"I've seen the resourceful mortal victim of a Malk Cleaver, something like an emotionally abusive ex-girlfriend who never really allowed him to 'get away', blackmail and bully the dependent vampire into first Ghouldom and eventually almost a full illegal Embrace by browbeating him and threatening with mutually assured destruction if he didn't share what he had. The combination of the toxic intimate relationship, Ghoulish devotion and possessiveness and that leverage made for a really cool and horrible dynamic. One of the few times that player has seriously impressed me.<br /> <br /> Best use of the Farmer's Feeding Exclusion flaw I feel like I've seen was my own vicious park hobo queen Gangrel. After a lifetime of various interpersonal trauma and basically giving up on relationships with other human beings she just couldn't <i>stand</i> the thought of muddling her own self with the disgusting feelings and energy and attitude of some yucky stranger.<br /> <br /> The Humanity boost frankly felt really out of place, because it wasn't about taking a moral stance at all but about protecting the purity of her own nature by absorbing the natural and unsentimental and comparatively 'clean' natures of the animals she devoured. Her revulsion at the other vampires' feeding habits was less 'Nooo, that's wrong!' and more 'Eeeeeeew! I can't believe you put that inside you! Don't you know what their minds are <i>like? </i>You <i>were</i> one! Don't you fucking dare tell me what he feels like, I'm already gonna need a shower just from standing near you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27456-mr-sharp","user":"Mr Sharp","date":". 06-09-2022, 01:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27456-mr-sharp","name":"Mr Sharp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}